{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109774","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109774/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109774/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109774/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109774","id":3334572407,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7GwYl3","number":109774,"title":"Some properties don't have defaults, because of `validate_property()`","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-08-19T14:17:01Z","updated_at":"2025-08-19T18:07:38Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nW10\n\n### Issue description\n\nSome properties don't have defaults defined. The defaults don't appear in the documentation and the properties are not revertible in the inspector:\n\n<img width=\"339\" height=\"198\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f4b25877-26ef-48e5-b0c5-e55d1514db52\" />\n\nThis is because `validate_property()` changes their usage, causing them to be skipped by ClassDB.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8ebf8ae23c095d4185e79602bb18a6952e192b56/core/object/class_db.cpp#L2229-L2232\n\nUnfortunately just removing the condition makes _all_ properties get defaults, even ones that are never serialized not appear in the inspector.\n\nClassDB should be able to fetch the defaults while bypassing `validate_property()`, because it's irrelevant in this context.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create ParticlesProcessMaterial\n2. Change emission shape to e.g. ring\n3. Change shape properties\n4. Can't revert\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109774/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109774/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}